  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed single storey rear extensions in conjunction with the existing enlargements to the host dwelling, by reason of the combined excessive volume and footprint would cause an inappropriate form of development within a Green Belt, to the detriment of the character, appearance and openness of a Green Belt, contrary to The National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policy G2 of the London Plan (2021), Policy GI1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021 – 2041), and no convincing ‘very special circumstances’ have been demonstrated whereby the harm by reason of said inappropriateness is outweighed by other considerations.&lt;/p&gt;"
